## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- BenchLM has no profile: `benchlm.ai/models/kimi-k2-8-preview` returns HTTP 404.
- models.dev carries the model (2026-09-11, 1M context, text/image/video in) but no benchmark fields.
- hokai.io's review states plainly: "Moonshot has published no benchmark scores for Kimi K2.8 Preview" — the vendor's claim is qualitative ("close to Kimi K3", "thinks more efficiently than K2.7 Code").
- benchmarklist.com and llm-stats.com list the model but expose no primary figures in the served HTML.
- Resolution: spec facts above are catalog-verified; the benchmark columns stay empty until Moonshot or an independent tracker publishes rows.

